    <description>2025-02-03: Now updating User (isActive, FederationId) from platform event to avoid queueable limit
2025-02-03: Had forgotten to update user on re-activation, it is now fixed.
2025-01-29: Now checks if running in a apex unittest context
2025-01-24: Now updates User from a separate transaction from apex action queueable avoiding mixed DML error
* Update for username and email generation for the new user no email path. 
* Changed the syntax for creation of Username
* refactoring + disable feed emails on member (Networkmember)
* Updated to set SocialSecurityNumber__c as Federation ID on User instead of MemberNumber__c
Used to create or activate or inactivate community users</description>
